<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>结果图像保存入口与导出分支</title><style>body{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:24px;background:#101a29;color:#e3edf8;font:15px/1.7 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}a{color:#96d1ff}p,small{color:#b0c6dc}.notice{background:#1c2d43;border-left:4px solid #dfb16e;padding:15px}details{background:#17273c;padding:14px;border:1px solid #3f5671;margin:14px 0}summary{cursor:pointer}.unknown{border-color:#d299ac}.independent-implementation{border-color:#70bef5}pre{font:12px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#0b1524;padding:12px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style><a href="index.html">← 架构索引</a> · <a href="rendering-layers.html#edge-C19">显示分层C19</a><h1>结果图像保存入口与导出分支</h1><p class="notice">原BAML菜单→ImageViewBox同步命令→OpenCV图像及形状导出→文件写入。12条原版有限事实、1条当前Runner独立实现和1条未知；30个选定原件体，未执行厂商对象、对话框、SDK、设备或服务。活绑定、原生效果及当前主WPF出口仍开放。</p><p><a href="image-export-entry-audit.json">完整专题JSON</a> · <a href="image-export-entry-audit.decompile.json">工具与源码摘要</a> · <a href="image-export-entry-audit.cil.json">原件CIL</a> · <a href="rendering-binding-resource-review.decode.json">原BAML来源</a></p><nav><a href="#E01">E01</a> · <a href="#E02">E02</a> · <a href="#E03">E03</a> · <a href="#E04">E04</a> · <a href="#E05">E05</a> · <a href="#E06">E06</a> · <a href="#E07">E07</a> · <a href="#E08">E08</a> · <a href="#E09">E09</a> · <a href="#E10">E10</a> · <a href="#E11">E11</a> · <a href="#E12">E12</a> · <a href="#C01">C01</a> · <a href="#U01">U01</a></nav><h2>菜单与命令</h2><details id="E01" class="source-confirmed"><summary>E01 · 原ImageViewBox BAML Viewbox.Style → ContextMenu两保存命令及显示门 · source-confirmed</summary><p>原载荷菜单分别绑定PlacementTarget.TemplatedParent.SaveOriginalImageCommand与SaveRenderImageCommand；叠加项Visibility另经bv取IsSaveRenderImageVisible；IsMenuVisible=false样式触发器把ContextMenu置null。这里只确认原载荷声明。</p><p>待核：运行中的PlacementTarget、TemplatedParent、converter结果及外部样式覆盖未验证。</p><details><summary>imageviewbox.baml · 52–53</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-binding-resource-review.workspace/decoded/base/imageviewbox.xaml · original-baml-offline-ilspy-extraction · SHA 1a376cf7ed4516a4e3e15402fa2a99eac6820d9905081339ee763e0e5920e68c</code></p><pre>                      &lt;MenuItem Header=&quot;{DynamicResource 保存原始图}&quot; Command=&quot;{Binding PlacementTarget.TemplatedParent.SaveOriginalImageCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource FindAncestor, AncestorLevel=1, AncestorType={x:Type ContextMenu}}}&quot; /&gt;
                      &lt;MenuItem Header=&quot;{DynamicResource RunParam_RenderImgEnable}&quot; Command=&quot;{Binding PlacementTarget.TemplatedParent.SaveRenderImageCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource FindAncestor, AncestorLevel=1, AncestorType={x:Type ContextMenu}}}&quot; Visibility=&quot;{Binding PlacementTarget.TemplatedParent.IsSaveRenderImageVisible, Converter={StaticResource bv}, RelativeSource={RelativeSource FindAncestor, AncestorLevel=1, AncestorType={x:Type ContextMenu}}}&quot; /&gt;</pre></details><details><summary>imageviewbox.baml · 61–63</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-binding-resource-review.workspace/decoded/base/imageviewbox.xaml · original-baml-offline-ilspy-extraction · SHA 1a376cf7ed4516a4e3e15402fa2a99eac6820d9905081339ee763e0e5920e68c</code></p><pre>                  &lt;DataTrigger Value=&quot;False&quot; Binding=&quot;{Binding IsMenuVisible, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Mode=TemplatedParent}}&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;Setter Property=&quot;FrameworkElement.ContextMenu&quot; Value=&quot;{x:Null}&quot; /&gt;
                  &lt;/DataTrigger&gt;</pre></details></details><details id="E02" class="source-confirmed"><summary>E02 · 原ModuleResultView imageView → 结果视图声明启用保存叠加入口 · source-confirmed</summary><p>原ModuleResultView载荷的imageView声明IsSaveRenderImageVisible=True，同时ImageDataSource与ShapeList/ShapeConvertMatrix取m_CurrentInfo相应值。可把此声明接到ImageViewBox具体命令体，但不能从静态节点证明实例当前已有图像。</p><p>待核：其它布局/多图实例、m_CurrentInfo的活值与通知须分别核查。</p><details><summary>moduleresultview.baml · 142–142</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/rendering-binding-resource-review.workspace/decoded/wpf/moduleresultview.xaml · original-baml-offline-ilspy-extraction · SHA 56ac6bbf9b8839311f4f8eaf0dc4407fc3f9527b39f3ad942080c0bb6c2948ff</code></p><pre>                  &lt;imagecontrol:ImageViewBox Name=&quot;imageView&quot; Margin=&quot;1&quot; IsDisplayPixelAuto=&quot;True&quot; IsSaveRenderImageVisible=&quot;True&quot; ImageDataSource=&quot;{Binding m_CurrentInfo.ImageDataSource, ElementName=us}&quot; ShapeConvertMatrix=&quot;{Binding m_CurrentInfo.ShapeMatrix, ElementName=us}&quot; CordinateShow=&quot;{Binding m_CurrentInfo.CorSelectIndex, ElementName=us}&quot; ShapeList=&quot;{Binding m_CurrentInfo.ShapeList, ElementName=us}&quot; MouseLeftButtonDown=&quot;imageView_MouseLeftButtonDown&quot;&gt;</pre></details><details><summary>VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox::get_IsSaveRenderImageVisible · 2322–2341</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/image-export-entry-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 3496589e41ca17d3b459cf5e6c451436766fa3aff3c39d04de6a8101b7f05fc0</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x060000fc&quot;,
