            {
              &quot;offset&quot;: 0,
              &quot;label&quot;: &quot;IL_0000&quot;,
              &quot;opcode&quot;: &quot;nop&quot;,</pre></details></details><h2>对话框与数据门</h2><details id="E04" class="source-confirmed"><summary>E04 · SaveOriginalImage → 图像非null→保存对话框→SaveRawImageSyn · source-confirmed</summary><p>在try内仅ImageDataSource非null时获取数据并建SaveFileDialog；Filter精确为JPG|*.jpg|JPEG|*.jpeg|PNG|*.png|BMP|*.bmp，标题本地化Lang_SaveAs，FileName为yyyyMMddHHmmss时间。ShowDialog()==true且FileName非空才同步保存原图，传入默认jpgQuality=0；异常经HikMessageBox显示ex.Message。</p><p>待核：真实对话框选择、覆盖询问、用户权限与文件结果未运行。</p><details><summary>VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox::SaveOriginalImage · 1370–1389</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/image-export-entry-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 3496589e41ca17d3b459cf5e6c451436766fa3aff3c39d04de6a8101b7f05fc0</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x060000fa&quot;,
