            {
              &quot;offset&quot;: 0,
              &quot;label&quot;: &quot;IL_0000&quot;,
              &quot;opcode&quot;: &quot;nop&quot;,</pre></details></details><details id="E05" class="source-confirmed"><summary>E05 · SaveRenderImage / 原编译过滤lambda → ShapeList可见性快照→对话框→SaveRoiImageSyn · source-confirmed</summary><p>图像非null后将ShapeList尝试作IEnumerable&lt;object&gt;，Where+ToList在对话框前形成快照；原lambda保留非IIsVisible对象以及IsVisible=true对象。对话框和接受门同原图分支；接受后把IImageData显式cast为ImageData，传shapesSource、controlImage=null、jpgQuality=0。整个入口catch并显示异常。</p><p>待核：集合后续变化不自动写入已取快照；Tuple内子形状未由此顶层lambda逐项筛选。</p><details><summary>VMBaseControls.ImageViewBox::SaveRenderImage · 2425–2444</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/image-export-entry-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 3496589e41ca17d3b459cf5e6c451436766fa3aff3c39d04de6a8101b7f05fc0</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x060000fe&quot;,
