              &quot;opcode&quot;: &quot;nop&quot;,</pre></details></details><details id="E06" class="source-confirmed"><summary>E06 · Save*Syn→CheckData / ImagePathCheck → 路径大小写、可选共享内存读取及数据长度门 · source-confirmed</summary><p>Syn直接进入私有dynamic方法，不经TaskFactory。CheckData先验证目录存在且扩展精确小写.jpg/.bmp/.png/.jpeg；非空MemoryAddress且Buffer为null才取共享映射并回写Buffer。再拒绝空buffer、长度既非width*height也非三倍、磁盘剩余小于Buffer.LongLength/8。未先按PixelFormat完成更严格长度一致性验证。</p><p>待核：整数乘法/磁盘查询异常和用户路径实际可写性由原分支处理，不能称已验证所有输入。</p><details><summary>Apps.Data.Common.ImageSaveOpenCvHelper::SaveRawImageSyn · 5294–5313</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/image-export-entry-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 3496589e41ca17d3b459cf5e6c451436766fa3aff3c39d04de6a8101b7f05fc0</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x0600026d&quot;,
