</pre></details></details><details id="E08" class="source-confirmed"><summary>E08 · SaveRoiImage(dynamic) / DrawShape → 图像坐标Mat上重绘有限形状分派 · source-confirmed</summary><p>shapes非null时顶层IShape交DrawShape；Tuple&lt;string,object&gt;且Item2为List&lt;object&gt;时逐个强制按IShape绘制。DrawShape对Opacity==0且非IMultiPoint早退，包含IMultiText按Position分组逐行偏移、圆/椭圆/环扇/线/矩形/点/坐标轴/多边形/折线/十字及IMultiPoint分支；未命中类型不绘制。这里是数据驱动的OpenCV绘图，不能继承WPF模板外观等价结论。</p><p>待核：每种Draw*具体几何、dash/fill与像素裁切未在此逐项关闭；上游可见性和各集合完整性仍有限。</p><details><summary>Apps.Data.Common.ImageSaveOpenCvHelper::SaveRoiImage · 7665–7684</summary><p><code>docs/architecture-recovery/image-export-entry-audit.cil.json · original-managed-cil · SHA 3496589e41ca17d3b459cf5e6c451436766fa3aff3c39d04de6a8101b7f05fc0</code></p><pre>          &quot;token&quot;: &quot;0x06000271&quot;,
