</pre></details></details><h2>当前实现与未知</h2><details id="C01" class="independent-implementation"><summary>C01 · 当前VisionRunner BMP入口 → OverlayPng.Write独立PNG导出 · independent-implementation</summary><p>当前Runner读取BMP后自行检测并交OverlayPng.Write；后者写RGB底图、圆/十字/边缘像素及PNG。它是独立实现，不代表原WPF上下文菜单已经接入当前主界面，也不承接原OpenCV文字/格式对话框语义。</p><p>待核：当前主WPF图像结果保存命令及UI出口仍未确认。</p><details><summary>Runner image input · 14–21</summary><p><code>src/VisionRunner/Program.cs · current-source · SHA c46c6bb1c826ce43ccd0451299edbd71b4af6e358050d927374073d49f1ee8ce</code></p><pre>    var image=BmpReader.Read(source); var started=System.Diagnostics.Stopwatch.StartNew();
    var result=RadialCircleDetector.Detect(image,options); started.Stop();
    var report=new { schema=&quot;vision-independent.circle.v1&quot;, imagePath, imageSha256=sha, image.Width, image.Height, options, result.Status, result.Circle, result.EdgePoints, result.OutOfBoundsSamples, elapsedMilliseconds=started.Elapsed.TotalMilliseconds,
        compatibility=&quot;unverified&quot;, parameterSource=&quot;explicit caller seed; not automatically recovered original ROI&quot;, limitations=new[]{&quot;Independent strongest-edge radial detector; vendor numeric equivalence unverified.&quot;,&quot;No vendor SDK or assemblies loaded.&quot;,&quot;No full .sol workflow execution, runtime scheduler, or camera integration.&quot;,&quot;No outlier rejection or angular coverage constraint.&quot;} };
    Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.GetDirectoryName(prefix)!);
    File.WriteAllText(prefix+&quot;.json&quot;,JsonSerializer.Serialize(report,new JsonSerializerOptions{WriteIndented=true,Converters={new System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonStringEnumConverter()}}));
    OverlayPng.Write(prefix+&quot;.png&quot;,image,result);
    Console.WriteLine(JsonSerializer.Serialize(new { result.Status, result.Circle, edgeCount=result.EdgePoints.Count, json=prefix+&quot;.json&quot;, overlay=prefix+&quot;.png&quot; },new JsonSerializerOptions{Converters={new System.Text.Json.Serialization.JsonStringEnumConverter()}}));</pre></details><details><summary>Independent PNG writer · 6–16</summary><p><code>src/VisionRunner/OverlayPng.cs · current-source · SHA 10fd70c065ea906ca3926f1fe997661282e23fc1e1e406bb08674e0883d3b516</code></p><pre>    public static void Write(string path,GrayImage image,CircleDetectionResult result) {
        int w=image.Width,h=image.Height; var rgb=new byte[checked(w*h*3)];
        for(int i=0;i&lt;image.Pixels.Length;i++) rgb[i*3]=rgb[i*3+1]=rgb[i*3+2]=image.Pixels[i];
        void Dot(int x,int y,byte r,byte g,byte b,int size=1) {for(int dy=-size;dy&lt;=size;dy++)for(int dx=-size;dx&lt;=size;dx++){int xx=x+dx,yy=y+dy;if((uint)xx&gt;=(uint)w||(uint)yy&gt;=(uint)h)continue;int at=(yy*w+xx)*3;rgb[at]=r;rgb[at+1]=g;rgb[at+2]=b;}}
        if(result.Circle is CircleFit c) {int count=(int)Math.Ceiling(c.Radius*8)+64;for(int i=0;i&lt;count;i++){double a=i*2*Math.PI/count;Dot((int)Math.Round(c.CenterX+c.Radius*Math.Cos(a)),(int)Math.Round(c.CenterY+c.Radius*Math.Sin(a)),255,0,120);}for(int d=-8;d&lt;=8;d++){Dot((int)Math.Round(c.CenterX)+d,(int)Math.Round(c.CenterY),255,0,120);Dot((int)Math.Round(c.CenterX),(int)Math.Round(c.CenterY)+d,255,0,120);}}
        foreach(var p in result.EdgePoints)Dot((int)Math.Round(p.X),(int)Math.Round(p.Y),0,220,80,2);
        using var output=File.Create(path);output.Write(new byte[]{137,80,78,71,13,10,26,10});var header=new byte[13];BinaryPrimitives.WriteInt32BigEndian(header,w);BinaryPrimitives.WriteInt32BigEndian(header.AsSpan(4),h);header[8]=8;header[9]=2;Chunk(output,&quot;IHDR&quot;,header);
        using var compressed=new MemoryStream();using(var zlib=new ZLibStream(compressed,CompressionLevel.Fastest,leaveOpen:true)){for(int y=0;y&lt;h;y++){zlib.WriteByte(0);zlib.Write(rgb,y*w*3,w*3);}}Chunk(output,&quot;IDAT&quot;,compressed.ToArray());Chunk(output,&quot;IEND&quot;,[]);
    }
    private static void Chunk(Stream output,string name,byte[] data){Span&lt;byte&gt; field=stackalloc byte[4];BinaryPrimitives.WriteInt32BigEndian(field,data.Length);output.Write(field);var type=Encoding.ASCII.GetBytes(name);output.Write(type);output.Write(data);uint crc=0xffffffff;foreach(byte b in type.Concat(data)){crc^=b;for(int bit=0;bit&lt;8;bit++)crc=(crc&amp;1)!=0?(crc&gt;&gt;1)^0xedb88320:crc&gt;&gt;1;}BinaryPrimitives.WriteUInt32BigEndian(field,~crc);output.Write(field);}
}</pre></details></details><details id="U01" class="unknown"><summary>U01 · 原声明/原托管调用链与当前Runner → 活绑定、原生像素、实际文件和当前主UI仍开放 · unknown</summary><p>专题关闭原结果图像控件保存入口与有限托管导出体缺失，保留原BAML活实例/命令激活、各形状全分支、OpenCV/Win32实现、编码文件/字体像素，以及当前主WPF导出的未知。没有执行厂商对象、对话框、SDK、设备或服务。</p><p>待核：不据静态体、字节相符、导出成功或本专题检查宣称全局入口完整、原生等价或产品实施完成。</p></details><p>主框架实施41/96＝42.71%（32包×3具名单元），本专题增量0。原版入口有限恢复不代表当前产品已接通或全局入口完整。</p></html><script data-document-web src="document-web-links.js"></script>